== a09_ctorexact
  san:    exit 0 ctorexact 1|ctorexact 12|
  O3:     exit 0 ctorexact 1|ctorexact 12|
  interp: exit 0 ctorexact 1|ctorexact 12|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/a09_ctorexact.debug.san
--- run san
ctorexact 1
ctorexact 12
--- run O3
ctorexact 1
ctorexact 12
--- interpret
ctorexact 1
ctorexact 12
